[N 44-46 Searing Gorge]
[D Forever Shaman 30-60 (Braedyn)\\The eastern trip at 45: Tiara of the Deep to Tabetha, the Menethil boat, The Witch Doctor's Head at the Dalaran crater, Nekrum's Medallion and the Divination at Nethergarde Keep, then the Searing Gorge by the Badlands road (Dorius, the outhouse, the Thorium Brotherhood board and Hansel's three hunts) and the Explorers' League in Ironforge.]
[GA Alliance]
[OC]|cffffffffLevel check|r  -  this chapter wants level 45: the Thorium Brotherhood board and Hansel's quests (7729, 7723, 7724, 7727, 7722) and the four Explorers' League pickups (2963, 3448, 3450, 3451) cannot be accepted below 45; their mobs are 45-49. You arrive at about 44.7. The hand-ins on the way (Tabetha, the crater, Nethergarde) and the Gorge quests that need 40-43 (Dorius, Caught!, Kalaran) come first and should carry you to 45 before the board. Still 44 at Thorium Point: kill Dark Iron Slavers (45-46) on the Cauldron's north rim until 45 (they count for the board quest once you have it, and the Outhouse Key can drop from them). Never accept a pickup under its level
[OC]|cffffffffThe eastern trip|r  -  you start at Bera Stonehammer in Gadgetzan where chapter 51 ended, hearth = Gadgetzan; it moves to Ironforge here. 18 quests, 60,540 XP and 9g of quest money, plus Prayer to Elune (470 XP) only if Zamael can be reached. Thorium Point's flight point is new: the way into the Gorge is on foot through the Badlands
[OC]|cffffcc00Carried in:|r Tiara of the Deep (2846), The Witch Doctor's Head (96770) and Nekrum's Medallion (2991), each complete from Zul'Farrak - or abandoned in chapter 51 if its boss item did not drop: then skip that quest's leg below (the note in front of each leg says how). If you still hold them: Alliance Trauma (6625), I Got Nothin' Left! (6609) or Nat Pagle, Angler Extreme (6607) for Theramore. Portents of Uldum at the end needs The Platinum Discs (2439, chapter 39e). Bring 15 Silk Cloth for the outhouse (bank or auction house in Ironforge)
[OC][A Shaman] |cffffcc00Training:|r the level 44 row in Ironforge if chapters 48-49 did not buy it; the level 46 row at the end of the chapter only if you are 46 (expected 45.5 there, so it mostly waits for chapter 57). The sheet buys Lesser Healing Wave 4 and Lightning Bolt 8 first from the 44 row, Mana Spring Totem 3 first from the 46 row, then Frost Shock 3 and Magma Totem 3

